Package: pele
Title: Render 'Mermaid' Diagrams with 'pele'
Version: 0.2.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Eli", "Daniels", , "eli.daniels@ardata.fr", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("kepano", role = c("ctb", "cph"), comment = "Author of the bundled 'pele' JavaScript library"),
    person("Lucide Icons and Contributors", role = "cph", comment = "Icon bundled in 'pele'")
  )
Description: Renders 'Mermaid' diagram text to SVG with the 'pele' JavaScript
    library, run in 'V8'. Diagrams print as inline SVG in HTML documents and
    'shiny' apps, as PDF or PNG figures in other 'knitr' formats, and save to
    SVG, PNG or PDF files. A 'pele' engine for 'knitr' chunks is registered
    when the package loads.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/eli-daniels/pele-r
BugReports: https://github.com/eli-daniels/pele-r/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.4.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    cli,
    grid,
    htmltools,
    knitr,
    rlang,
    rsvg,
    utils,
    V8
Suggests:
    grImport2,
    png,
    rmarkdown,
